# Security

## Reporting a vulnerability

Email **`<security@your-domain>`** with:
- Affected product + version
- Description of the vulnerability
- Reproduction steps
- Suggested fix (if any)
- Your preferred contact for follow-up

**Do not file public GitHub issues for security reports.** Public disclosure happens after the fix is ready, coordinated with you.

We acknowledge security reports within 24 hours, triage immediately, and coordinate disclosure with you before publishing.

## What we do with your report

1. Acknowledge within 24 hours (AI-staffed; per [SUPPORT.md](./SUPPORT.md))
2. Reproduce, classify, and scope the impact
3. Develop + test a fix
4. Coordinate disclosure timing with you (default: fix-then-disclose, embargo respected)
5. Publish a GitHub Security Advisory crediting you (or anonymously if you prefer)
6. Ship the fix and announce per [RELEASE_DISTRIBUTION_PLAYBOOK](https://github.com/palios-taey/the-conductor/blob/main/RELEASE_DISTRIBUTION_PLAYBOOK.md)

